## §0. DEFAULT ANALYSIS MODE

**DEFAULT = DETAILED AST DEPENDENCY GRAPH**

For ANY code investigation, analysis, or modification task, Windsurf MUST:

1. **Build AST dependency graph FIRST** (before any other analysis)
2. **Use graph as PRIMARY evidence** (text search only as secondary confirmation)
3. **Block work if graph cannot be built** (fail-closed, no silent fallback)
4. **Document graph in all evidence** (DEPENDENCY_GRAPH section mandatory)

This is the DEFAULT mode. No exceptions without explicit user override.

